# kona-inertia milestone enforcement

Before implementation, read `AGENTS.md` and `MILESTONES.md`.

## Laws

1. One active milestone at a time.
2. Develop to exhaustion within scope.
3. 100% line + branch coverage on production code; CI fails below 100%.
4. Keep the full regression suite green.
5. Kotlin-first; every public API milestone includes Java-callable usage and Java sample/regression.
6. Ship via PR → green CI → automerge.
7. Never embed Quarkus, Micronaut, or Spring.
8. NEVER adjust GitHub rulesets.

## Docs

Exhaustive feature guides live in `apps/docs/`. Kona’s public site must only brief + link here.
